  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A flexible string of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> is fixed at both ends and held under tension. The speed of a transverse wave on the string is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. Which of the following expressions correctly represents the frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_n\"></span> of the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n^{th}\"></span> harmonic mode of the standing wave, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 1, 2, 3, \\dots\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_n = \\frac{nv}{2L}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_n = \\frac{v}{2nL}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_n = \\frac{nv}{L}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_n = \\frac{2nv}{L}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
